# Task 143-013: Auto-Archive Guard (Task 3 Regression Protection)

## Problem
`archiveOrphanTasks()` in sprint-docs-updater.ts archives ALL task files matching the sprint prefix,
including PENDING and EXECUTING tasks. This is destructive — if a sprint crashes mid-execution
and cleanup runs, in-progress tasks are lost.

## Solution

### 1. Create `src/orchestra/task-restoration.ts`
- `createPreArchiveSnapshot(projectRoot, sprintId)` — tar.gz + SHA-256 hash before archive
- `verifySnapshot(snapshotPath, expectedHash)` — verify integrity
- `restoreFromSnapshot(projectRoot, sprintId)` — restore tasks from snapshot
- `getActiveTaskStatuses(tasksDir, sprintPrefix)` — read task JSON to check status
- `filterArchivableTasks(files, tasksDir, sprintPrefix)` — only DONE/NO_GO files are archivable

### 2. Modify `sprint-finalizer.ts` Step 12b
- Before calling `archiveOrphanTasks()`, call `createPreArchiveSnapshot()`
- Replace direct `archiveOrphanTasks()` call with guarded version that preserves PENDING/EXECUTING

### 3. Tests (10+)
- Snapshot creation with correct hash
- Snapshot hash verification (valid + tampered)
- PENDING task preservation during archive
- EXECUTING task preservation during archive
- DONE task archived correctly
- NO_GO task archived correctly
- Restore roundtrip from snapshot
- Empty tasks dir handling
- Missing snapshot file error handling
- Multiple status mix (DONE + PENDING + EXECUTING)

## Files Changed
- src/orchestra/task-restoration.ts (NEW)
- src/orchestra/sprint-finalizer.ts (MODIFIED)
- tests/orchestra/auto-archive.test.ts (NEW)
